code: 0
--- stdout
The approved pull request has been merged into main

  From:      Approved
  To:        Merged; an issue already there keeps it, so a repeat is safe
  Refused:   while the issue has the label blocked (exit code 2): ask the user
             resume removes it
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue numbers
  Optional:  --comment
  Batch:     several numbers at once: gh dojo merged 12 13 14; each issue is applied
             on its own, a failed one is skipped, and a summary ends the run:
             "3 of 4 done; #17: <reason>"; a re-run skips what is done
             exit code: 0 all done; 5 some written and a re-run may finish the rest;
             else the failures' code, 2 first, then 1, 4, 3
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Close:     closes the issue as completed; an issue already closed stays as it is
  Comment:   posted unless it renders empty or is already the latest gh-dojo comment:
               {comment}

Usage:
  gh dojo merged <N>... [flags]

Flags:
      --comment string   text for {comment} in the comment
      --dry-run          print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help             help for merged

Global Flags:
  -q, --jq expression       filter the JSON with a jq expression (implies --json)
      --json                print the result as JSON (schema_version 1), errors too
  -t, --template template   format the JSON with a Go template (implies --json)
--- stderr
